# TrendForge core

- Read [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md) + [GOALS.md](GOALS.md) for identity, ship bar (G1), and loops
- Stack: React 19 + Vite + Tailwind 4 + Vercel serverless (`api/x-search.js`, `api/forge-chat.js`)
- Production: `https://trendforge-opal.vercel.app`
- Secrets never in client/git/chat: `X_BEARER_TOKEN`, `XAI_API_KEY` — Vercel / `vercel dev` only
- Prefer pure helpers + tests in `src/lib/`; keep `App.tsx` as orchestration
- No auto-post to X; every ship is a human gate
- After meaningful UI/API changes: `npm run lint && npm run test && npm run build`
- Ship small vertical slices; one mission per session
